{"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch).","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"init","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initialEntities","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"type":"text","text":" record changes — the data is already persisted."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"first-load"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" hydration only. Do not use this initializer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to “refresh from disk” mid-session by assigning into a live ","type":"text"},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"state.items = EntityStore(fetched)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from a CloudKit re-hydrate action).","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In-memory state may hold unflushed writes or live UI bindings; wholesale"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replacement silently drops them and surfaces as lost keystrokes. Use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/merge(from:shouldReplace:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for that path — it records no changes and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lets you decide per-ID which side wins. Under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPersistentCloudKitContainer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the gotcha is especially sharp: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".NSPersistentStoreRemoteChange"},{"type":"text","text":" fires for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"local saves too, so a naïve “refresh on remote change” observer feeds the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app its own writes."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Entities sharing an ID are collapsed to the first occurrence. A store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot represent duplicates — ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" holds one index per ID — and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"admitting them corrupts the index: the map would keep only the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index while the array kept every copy, so ","type":"text"},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" over-reports and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"later delete orphans the earlier copy with no ","type":"text"},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry at all,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaving a row that is visible in ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/values","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" but invisible to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and the subscript. Persisted rows can legitimately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"share an ID (CloudKit forbids unique constraints), so this initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has to be total rather than trusting its input."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"title":"init(_:)","modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"symbolKind":"init","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Initializer","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreVyACyxGSayxGcfc"},"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/init(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/init(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"([","kind":"text"},{"text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/init(_:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a store pre-populated from an array (e.g. first-load hydration at app launch)."}],"title":"init(_:)"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/contains(_:)":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contains","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"contains(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/contains(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/contains(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"Whether an entity with this ID exists.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","url"